Label kv0 $K_{0},\ V_{0}$
Label acc0 $Z_{1},\ U_{1}$
Label kv1 $K_{1},\ V_{1}$
Label acc1 $Z_{2},\ U_{2}$
Label kv2 $K_{2},\ V_{2}$
Label acc2 $Z_{3},\ U_{3}$
Label output $o_s=U_3/Z_3$
Label query $r_t=1+\operatorname{relu}(q_s^\top k_t)$
Label sizes $\text{each tile: }n\text{ positions}$
Label initial $0,\,0$
Label addz $Z_{c+1}=Z_c+\sum_{t\in\mathrm{tile}\ c}r_t$
Label addu $U_{c+1}=U_c+\sum_{t\in\mathrm{tile}\ c}r_t v_t$
Label norm "normalize once"
